```

---

## ⚡ Installation

1. Clone the repo:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/your-username/ticket-booking-system.git
   cd ticket-booking-system
   ```

2. Install dependencies:

   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

3. Start the server:

   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

   Server will run at **[http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)**

---

## 📡 API Endpoints

### 1. View all seats

```
GET /booking/seats
```

Response:

```json
{
  "1": { "status": "available" },
  "2": { "status": "locked", "lockedBy": "userA" },
  "3": { "status": "booked", "bookedBy": "userB" }
}
```

### 2. Lock a seat

```
POST /booking/lock/:id
Body: { "userId": "userA" }
```

3. Confirm a booking

```
POST /booking/confirm/:id
Body: { "userId": "userA" }
```

## 🧪 Testing

* Try locking the same seat with **two users** → only one succeeds.
* If a seat is not confirmed in 1 minute, it becomes **available again**.
* Confirming without a lock → returns an **error**.

